{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "537cf1c9c1080510b5908fa7a385293f25489b2c8c37a8a3d478dc22978fb068", "ja": "Team6thがデビュー出演した\n『ミュージックナイトTV』の録画視聴会……", "zh": "Team6th出道出演的\n《音乐之夜TV》录像观看会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "859a93d42ecee86a55a31e39609f1bb60f2e7284d036257fdcacd8e6de459907", "ja": "はあ～……あたしたち、本当にテレビに出たんだねぇ。\n何回見ても信じられないべさ……。", "zh": "唉～……我们真的上电视了呢。\n不管看多少遍，还是觉得难以置信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "8b77a5fe3d97e64b4949121826bc842ba11232bfdfda56e16f2793048ff1639c", "ja": "こうして画面の中で舞う姿を見ても、\nなんだか自分とは思えません……。", "zh": "即使看到我们这样在画面中翩翩起舞的模样，也总觉得不像是自己……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "3d1b75aed07e53484362a8fe146eb394a85ea990c8b317a125ec9e7fecbcc958", "ja": "で・も！　ふたりとも、とってもかわいかったヨ！\n本物のお姫さまみたいで♪", "zh": "但是！你们两个都特别可爱哦！\n简直就像真正的公主一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "e977336333722063631b1dbaf06a4dd14cefcd031e9f9311afb4faf6ad3d29cb", "ja": "お姫さま……！\nエレナさん、本当かい？", "zh": "公主……！\n艾莲娜，你说真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "4aaad9f1bfc7b3bd30cdd90c57825ca700ee24380d86efc86031393d64506883", "ja": "もちろん！　一番近くで見てたワタシが\n言うんだから、間違いないでしょ♪", "zh": "当然啦！离得最近的我\n都这么说了，绝对不会有错的吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "a565bc1f7f3748f04e1feff9f2b91d4f552a24426c25955053a9e9ba34ae1d65", "ja": "ヒナタもエミリーも、とびきりのお姫さまで、\nとびきりのアイドルだったヨー！", "zh": "日向和艾米莉都是最最棒的公主，也是最最棒的偶像哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "88cae86b411581a3f432c793fef701f3295b3aef710b61d335ddb4a7fb5e6c19", "ja": "とびきりの、大和撫子……！　そ、そのような\n言葉をいただくのは、ま、まだ早いでしゅ！", "zh": "出类拔萃的大和抚子……！还、还没到能被这样称赞的时候啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "cb7ce4dc9cb36588c5faae4e614d714831ca94fcf77874f362dffe628fa5ff35", "ja": "なあなあ、オレは？\nオレ、家でこの番組ぜんぜん見れなくってさ～。", "zh": "喂喂，那我呢？\n我在家完全看不了这个节目啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "3703c8dd40b49da8d7ac33af1ec623abab7d7ba083019e7646e675ba970d258f", "ja": "昴ちゃんもバッチリだったのですよ♪\nもしかして、録画を忘れてしまったのです？", "zh": "昴也表现得很棒哦♪\n该不会是忘记录下来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8b16cc656987fbcfe73e6cfb69221d4b51df475445fb71f6687676a82b6a2bc", "ja": "いや、録画はしたんだけど……見ようとすると、\nすぐ兄ちゃんたちが集まってくるんだよ～！", "zh": "不是啦，虽然录下来了……可是每次一想看，哥哥们就马上围过来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "da73588dff9593ad8d377a6b674cbd530e838c3c102afb77a7aec9c5e471d08d", "ja": "そんで、隣であーだこーだ感想いい始めるから、\n全然落ち着いて見直しできなくってさー。", "zh": "然后，他们还会在旁边叽叽喳喳地开始说感想，搞得我根本没法静下心来好好重看嘛——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5575c772c62e295c5121e9fa160572a3d56fa454711526e455ae01521860640", "ja": "ふふっ、仲良しさんなのですね♪", "zh": "呵呵，关系真好呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "a05bb77fe6a78165336d5a005927fec1293e783b9b8dbe2a1223d830283ed9c0", "ja": "どこが～？　とにかく、家じゃダメだから\n劇場でじっくり見直したいんだってば～！", "zh": "哪里像了～？总之，在家不行啦，我就是想在剧场好好重新看一遍嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "c224cf79faa90d44ea39fc07b278ad9ca7fb87754d6064dc01cf085934d7ee64", "ja": "了解なのです♪　では、見直しの続きは……\nプロデューサーさんのお話の後に、なのです♪", "zh": "明白啦♪那么，接下来的复盘就等制作人先生说完话后再继续吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "556eb8483e99e9c43ccdf4f0443626924c973f5d8c98be48f003b318fa5c0b50", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "47f5d109b07b5e0722a73ceb13173c02e8c1cc6f6ed3677ee7ac9f8bc572fed3", "ja": "お疲れさまなのです！", "zh": "辛苦了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "b322e4e3c09363513194695518a6998167749d58088fd4e553fea983e4ae08af", "ja": "お疲れさまだヨ～！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "87f57d92cf04f92a7f9be9853cf9f6122be1ee1e50e2a78aa0bcadb98305e633", "ja": "お疲れさま！", "zh": "辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "c4179375a4aa74922098c97cd885c493baa5e8893003831c1abdb860b0d59408", "ja": "お疲れさんです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "4dc4e5e4e44c444db95049a848f543953c34f8f6c0e85dd4c251dab457079cdc", "ja": "おっ、『ミュージックナイトTV』みてたのか。\nやっぱり、見返したくなっちゃうよな。", "zh": "哦，你在看《Music Night TV》啊。果然还是会忍不住想再看一遍呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "e0fc186669efe3eee272f11f268fa3c4c9db8700fb9ac87c00c98b06d3ab9947", "ja": "何度見ても、恥ずかしくなってしまうんだけども……\n慣れなくちゃいけないねぇ。", "zh": "不管看多少遍，还是会觉得不好意思……可是，也得习惯才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "6fede31fd7a1fee692b9b49838044c5466d2d5d487adab527c705bb322545b19", "ja": "はい。自分の舞をしっかりと見直して、\n少しでも上達しなくては！", "zh": "是的。得好好重新审视自己的舞蹈，哪怕只进步一点也好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "edf22f34de4be07c442f69fcb1b4de5a7dca7e0e9209b9b230304cf15fd5d8dd", "ja": "野球でも、自分のフォーム見直すのってすっげー\n大事だもんな。次の試合までに修正しないとさ！", "zh": "打棒球的时候，重新检查自己的动作也特别重要啊。得在下一场比赛前改过来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "89803f62754b31547dd715aa6bf24a877f15a1677c27f63ebf43674dcc0edca8", "ja": "うん、頼もしい限りだよ。ということで、早速だけど\n次の試合……じゃなくて、仕事の話だ。", "zh": "嗯，真靠得住啊。言归正传，虽然有点突然，\n不过该聊聊下一场比赛……不对，是下一份工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "6d08b1f94193aa551691eb3bd43731f170af0bd27c0b4669787e84111e23edd3", "ja": "今度、ファンとの交流イベントとして、\nTeam6thの撮影会を開催しようと思う！", "zh": "下次，我想举办一场Team6th的拍摄会，作为与粉丝交流的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "d2c15000a15f187c4386cce7d1b51a503916d62c1d66d932229258fcbdadae7c", "ja": "テーマはずばり……\n『5人のお姫さまと、ティーパーティー』だ！", "zh": "主题就是……『5位公主的茶会』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "9810ef06b67b817ef55e656b3198b8534d509cda6dd7c3281cd7326d888ba10d", "ja": "ほ！？　5人のお姫さまと……", "zh": "咦！？5位公主和……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
