{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "d2f0e7ca7b04ad268c763432004febb47240b050c736ce8d668b66222a6ea12a", "ja": "このチームの雰囲気、温かさを伝えるには\nこういう距離の近いイベントがいいと思ってね。", "zh": "我觉得要传达这个团队的氛围和温暖，举办这种能拉近彼此距离的活动比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1037_401pro", "source_sha256": "2d68ea3d0288a666056bffb8529bb1e8a0107f89cae9a6949541f7902ee0f2fa", "ja": "もちろんライブステージもやってもらうぞ。\n前回のTV収録とは、かなり勝手が違うと思うけど……", "zh": "当然也会让你们上台表演。\n虽然我觉得情况应该和上次的电视录制大不相同就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1038_021mat", "source_sha256": "32eb8c96ef5a82e0f2f3afa53087e9b8dbe2108ac8b1b47b9d3da1b0e93081f1", "ja": "とっても、わんだほー！なお仕事なのです！\nプロデューサーさん、ありがとうなのです♪", "zh": "真是超棒的工作呢！\n制作人，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1039_401pro", "source_sha256": "f8d9ae66faaf2bd8b1b9842ed69a9ac2b1d7382151a03478c7f1031d22b2da25", "ja": "……よかった。\n気に入ってもらえたみたいだな。", "zh": "……太好了。\n看来你很喜欢啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "75692d6f960d2680784e07128454af20a028da702538f91a6ad3ff9371292164", "ja": "もちろんなのです！　テーマも内容も、\n姫たちにピッタリ！なのです♪　……ね！", "zh": "那是当然的！主题和内容，\n都超级适合公主她们！哦♪……对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "d228edb27274ce0b6ae0e19537f59c0dd83a35fc686c7d63f2f44306479dbbac", "ja": "つまりー、お茶飲んで写真撮って歌うんだろ？　オレも\nカワイイって思われるようがんばるぜ！　がんばるわ！", "zh": "也就是说，要喝茶、拍照、唱歌，对吧？我也会努力让大家觉得我很可爱！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "dc6191e96bca17c0575cfd1a6056330a6bc2e71c343d8417575d34d86e87ecc7", "ja": "ワタシもファンになってくれたみんなと仲良くしたい\nって思ってたんだ！　すっごく楽しみだヨー♪", "zh": "我也一直想着要和成为粉丝的大家好好相处！超级期待的哟♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1043_035hin", "source_sha256": "0f1f6ec064da5c10b0a2c11c4c95406c894b0b4eb7bd2785414f78ad5ac5041a", "ja": "お茶会ってことなら、ばあちゃんに送ってもらった\nりんごで、なにか振る舞えるかもしれないねぇ。", "zh": "既然是茶会，那用奶奶寄来的苹果，说不定能做点什么招待大家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "d66ea4f29449c3c419f8b5ec52dfbb4c93e50d15072ad68570d41bf51aa8a701", "ja": "私も大和撫子として粗相のないよう、\nごヒイキ様方をしっかりおもてなししたいと思います♪", "zh": "我也想以大和抚子应有的风范，不失礼数地好好招待各位贵客♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "4b03392ef974646bce3d9e6e9c3bf196e07df01322fd39c628e39595d4671902", "ja": "……お姫さまたちもやる気まんまんなのです。とびきり\nわんだほー！なティーパーティーをお約束するのです♪", "zh": "……公主们也是干劲满满呢。向你保证，\n这一定会是一场无比精彩美妙的茶会哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_intro_1046_401pro", "source_sha256": "51244185370380256a973f7221d6519e094cdddae01f7390a2ed0fddf9989182", "ja": "ああ、企画のアイディアも助かるよ！\nTeam6thらしい撮影会、みんなで作り上げていこう！", "zh": "啊，企划的点子也帮大忙了！\n一起打造一场独具Team6th风格的拍摄会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
